I'll put this out as a suggestion as others may disagree with the approach.  In mcux_os_timer.c I would leave mcux_lpc_ostick_isr alone and add
void test_mcux_lpc_ostick_isr(void)
{
    mcux_lpc_ostick_isr(NULL);
}

Then _irq_vector_table can reference test_mcux_lpc_ostick_isr().  This solves the problem where you are implicitly casting the "void *" to "void" with the extern declaration of mcux_lpc_ostick_isr here.
